<overview>
<p>ComStar organized its military forces around a combined-arms doctrine that valued infantry as an essential element of the Level I through Level VI command structure, with conventional platoons serving alongside BattleMechs, armor, and aerospace assets at every echelon. Operating heavy field autocannon, these crews deliver punishing direct fire capable of damaging medium-weight combat vehicles, providing organic heavy weapons support that reduces a formation's dependence on armor assets.</p>
</overview>

